{
 "_source": "GT-- 1.3.10's naquadah line as the pack loads it (gtnn-1.20.1-1.3.10.jar, pinned in pack/mods/gtnn.pw.toml), read from the native recipe dump of the power-quests-1 bench run (2026-10-25, tools/test kubejs-exported/recipes.json, format gg-recipes-1): the original recipes of every stage that data/grindless/tables/naquadah_plant.json pins, and GT--'s three emptied centrifuge placeholders. Cross-checked against the jar's dev.arbor.gtnn.data.recipes.NaquadahLine (LuV A2, spike S0-11).",
 "_how_it_is_used": [
  "tools/analysis/test/naquadah-mode2.test.mjs runs server_scripts/grindless/lib/compose.js and iv/naquadah_plant.js on these recipes (a stand-in for ServerEvents.recipes' originalRecipes) and checks every mode's balance against docs/eras/luv.md and docs/eras/iv.md.",
  "When pack/mods/gtnn.pw.toml moves to another GT-- version the test fails on purpose: dump the new pack natively, rebuild this file from it (same ids) with the new gtnnVersion, set the table's gtnnVersion, and re-check the balance before accepting it.",
  "liveComposed is the naquadah plant's mode 1 recipe as the same native run built it: the stand-in must compose exactly that.",
  "related: recipes the modes rely on outside the plant: GTM's recycling macerator turns reactor III's spent long naquadah rod (gtceu:naquadah_reactor/naquadah_reactor_iii returns gtceu:long_naquadah_rod) into one naquadah dust, circuit 3's input."
 ],
